"""Realm beasts: every kingdom gets monsters of its own shape instead of re-tinted wolves, boars and stumps.
Same chibi skeleton (SK_BK_Chibi) and clips as build_beasts, so the game animates them unchanged — only the volumes,
markings and faces differ, and they differ in silhouette (shells, wings, hoods, trunks, tails), not just in colour.

    .venv/bin/python build_realm_beasts.py [out_dir] [--only hedgehog,tortoise,...] [--size 512]

Outputs <name>.glb + preview_<name>.png like build_beasts (copy the GLBs to web/client/public/assets/).
"""
import math
import os
import sys

